<title>USA: ICE HOCKEY-STANDINGS FROM THE WORLD CUP OF HOCKEY.</title>
<headline>ICE HOCKEY-STANDINGS FROM THE WORLD CUP OF HOCKEY.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>World Cup of Hockey standings after games played on Monday (tabulated under played, won, drawn, lost, goals for, against, points):</p>
<p>		   EUROPEAN DIVISION</p>
<p> Sweden	     3   3   0   0  14   3   6</p>
<p> Finland	    3   2   0   1  17  11   4</p>
<p> Germany	    3   1   0   2  11  15   2</p>
<p> Czech Republic   3   0   0   3   4  17   0</p>
<p>		   AMERICAN DIVISION</p>
<p> U.S.		 2   2   0   0  10   5   4</p>
<p> Canada	     3   2   0   1  11  10   4</p>
<p> Russia	     3   1   0   2  12  14   2</p>
<p> Slovakia	   2   0   0   2   7   9   0</p>
</text>
